  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**KVM-Sentinel-SOC** - live view of the SSH honeypot on `vm-honeypot` (10.10.0.10).\n\n* Every line below comes from `/opt/honeypot/logs/auth.log`, shipped by promtail to Loki (`{job=\"ssh-honeypot\"}`).\n* The AI pipeline (parse -> detect -> analyse -> report) writes its verdict in `vm2-soc/reports/` and asks the host operator for approval before quarantining the VM.\n* A brute force is: **more than 5 failed logins from one IP within 30 s**."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Failed SSH logins (last 1h)",
      "description": "Total failed password attempts in the last hour.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({job=\"ssh-honeypot\"} |= \"Failed password\" [1h]))",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "failures"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 100
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Distinct attacker IPs (last 1h)",
